      Q. 2 
      <b><span class="alpheios-lex-ar" lang="ara">تَصَنْدَلَ</span></b>  <i>He exerted himself in amatory
conversation</i> or <i>dalliance with women.</i> (Ibn-
'Abbád, O, K.) ＝   
    <p class="alpheios-lex-sense-separator"> </p><span class="alpheios-lex-sense-spacer1"> </span>-A2-  And <i>He wore what is termed
the</i> <span class="alpheios-lex-ar" lang="ara">صَنْدَل</span>, <i>a thing resembling the boot, with nails
in the sole.</i> (Msb.)

